{"id": "bvhpf-tier3-still-funded", "title": "On the Controller's highest-risk list, still paid $17.5M a year", "seconds": 130.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "tempo": 1.006, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "9213a9a5b67a5278", "words": 403, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation runs methadone, mental-health and shelter programs for the City.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.97, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Bayview Hunters Point Foundation", "sub": "methadone, mental-health and shelter programs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.8, 1.08, 1.64, 1.92, 2.69, 3.28, 3.39, 3.73, 4.21, 4.34, 4.44]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[1]"], "text": "Each year, the City Controller ranks troubled nonprofits.", "t0": 5.09, "t1": 7.58, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Tier 3", "sub": "serious risk to public funds and client services"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.46, 0.56, 0.77, 1.16, 1.4, 1.71]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[1]"], "text": "Tier 3, the most serious, means serious risk to public funds and client services.", "t0": 7.7, "t1": 11.77, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Tier 3", "sub": "serious risk to public funds and client services"}, "emph": ["Tier 3"], "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.61, 0.76, 0.96, 1.44, 1.68, 2.08, 2.35, 2.47, 2.79, 3.03, 3.13, 3.44]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In fiscal 2025, how many nonprofits citywide were on Tier 3?", "t0": 11.89, "t1": 15.93, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Tier 3 in fiscal 2025", "sub": "nonprofits citywide"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.45, 0.69, 1.44, 1.6, 1.79, 2.36, 2.82, 2.97, 3.07, 3.27]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Two. This foundation was one.", "t0": 15.93, "t1": 17.96, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "2", "label": "nonprofits on Tier 3, fiscal 2025", "sub": "sustained on Tier 3 from FY23"}, "emph": ["Two."], "wt": [0.04, 0.82, 1.09, 1.56, 1.74]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "That’s an official finding, by the Controller. The foundation has been on Tier 3 since fiscal 2023.", "t0": 18.48, "t1": 24.09, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Sustained on Tier 3 from FY23"}, "emph": ["official finding"], "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.35, 0.71, 1.2, 1.37, 1.47, 2.42, 2.59, 3.12, 3.24, 3.39, 3.49, 3.72, 4.08, 4.33, 4.7, 4.98]}, {"scene": "why", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "story[1]"], "text": "Why? It failed 29 monitoring standards in fiscal 2024, and 3 in 2025.", "t0": 24.31, "t1": 30.47, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["standards unmet, FY2024", "29"], "b": ["standards unmet, FY2025", "3"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.88, 1.04, 1.28, 1.83, 2.31, 2.76, 2.88, 3.29, 3.56, 4.5, 4.69, 5.1, 5.25, 5.5]}, {"scene": "why", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "story[1]"], "text": "The ones left are audits, and running at a loss.", "t0": 30.59, "t1": 32.75, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["standards unmet, FY2024", "29"], "b": ["standards unmet, FY2025", "3"]}, "emph": ["audits"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.33, 0.57, 0.72, 1.1, 1.27, 1.53, 1.61, 1.68]}, {"scene": "why", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Two years of its audits were still unfinished in May 2026.", "t0": 32.87, "t1": 36.06, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The FY22-23 and FY23-24 audits are still not complete as of May 2026."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.43, 0.51, 0.64, 1.01, 1.14, 1.36, 1.84, 1.97, 2.22, 2.49]}, {"scene": "why", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The City paid it about 31 million dollars in those two years.", "t0": 36.18, "t1": 39.12, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The FY22-23 and FY23-24 audits are still not complete as of May 2026."}, "emph": ["31 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.38, 0.6, 0.69, 0.92, 1.39, 1.68, 2.05, 2.14, 2.32, 2.5]}, {"scene": "why", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[9]", "notEstablished[6]"], "text": "Its 2023 tax return says a required federal audit wasn’t done.", "t0": 39.24, "t1": 42.87, "shot": "b_990", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a federal single audit was required and was not done", "kicker": "Form 990, year to June 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.49, 0.99, 1.26, 1.62, 1.8, 1.89, 2.3, 2.66, 2.99, 3.29]}, {"scene": "why", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[10]"], "text": "The last one on file, for 2021, had a finding: a significant deficiency on Medicaid money.", "t0": 42.99, "t1": 48.93, "shot": "b_fac", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$796,681", "label": "Medicaid money through Public Health", "sub": "one finding, a significant deficiency: fiscal 2021 audit, the last on file"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.39, 0.54, 0.68, 1.24, 1.43, 1.69, 2.43, 2.58, 2.65, 3.75, 3.86, 4.38, 5.01, 5.18, 5.6]}, {"scene": "why", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]", "innocent[0]"], "text": "City departments say new leadership has fixed most other problems.", "t0": 49.05, "t1": 52.31, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "New leadership", "sub": "most corrective items resolved; the audit outstanding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.78, 1.07, 1.29, 1.76, 1.91, 2.21, 2.45, 2.66]}, {"scene": "why", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]", "innocent[0]"], "text": "They put the backlog down to a late audit and finance staff turnover.", "t0": 52.43, "t1": 55.6, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "New leadership", "sub": "most corrective items resolved; the audit outstanding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.25, 0.36, 0.79, 1.09, 1.29, 1.37, 1.59, 1.89, 2.01, 2.36, 2.64]}, {"scene": "money", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "The money didn’t slow. 6.74 million dollars in fiscal 2021.", "t0": 55.82, "t1": 60.11, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "City payments to the foundation", "rows": [["FY2026", "$17.52M"], ["FY2025", "$17.84M"], ["FY2022", "$16.43M"], ["FY2021", "$6.74M"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.31, 0.54, 1.3, 1.58, 1.83, 2.13, 2.35, 2.64, 3.0, 3.11, 3.47, 3.75]}, {"scene": "money", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "16.43 million the next year. In fiscal 2026?", "t0": 60.23, "t1": 64.54, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "City payments to the foundation", "rows": [["FY2026", "$17.52M"], ["FY2025", "$17.84M"], ["FY2022", "$16.43M"], ["FY2021", "$6.74M"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.74, 0.94, 1.15, 1.47, 1.57, 1.81, 2.51, 2.69, 3.07, 3.36]}, {"scene": "money", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "amount"], "text": "17.52 million dollars.", "t0": 64.54, "t1": 66.5, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$17.52M", "label": "City payments, fiscal 2026", "sub": "all departments"}, "emph": ["17.52"], "wt": [0.04, 0.51, 0.76, 1.02, 1.18, 1.47]}, {"scene": "nobid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "Then, in July 2025, already on Tier 3, it got a new shelter deal: the Bayview Navigation Center.", "t0": 67.12, "t1": 73.14, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Bayview Navigation Center", "kicker": "July 1, 2025", "sub": "contract 1000035389, no competitive bidding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.53, 0.86, 1.11, 1.8, 2.17, 2.26, 2.47, 3.12, 3.26, 3.41, 3.48, 3.64, 3.98, 4.59, 4.73, 5.13, 5.7]}, {"scene": "nobid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "No competitive bidding. Its ceiling?", "t0": 73.26, "t1": 75.68, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Bayview Navigation Center", "kicker": "July 1, 2025", "sub": "contract 1000035389, no competitive bidding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.67, 1.47, 1.7]}, {"scene": "nobid", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "9,989,926 dollars.", "t0": 75.68, "t1": 76.94, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9,989,926", "label": "ceiling: $8,879,934 budget plus $1,109,992 contingency"}, "emph": ["9,989,926"], "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.49, 0.76]}, {"scene": "nobid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "That’s 10,074 dollars under the amount that needs a Board vote. No document says why that figure was chosen.", "t0": 77.46, "t1": 83.44, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "votes on deals past $10M", "chip": "$10,074 under the line"}, "emph": ["10,074"], "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.55, 0.98, 1.5, 1.94, 2.16, 2.26, 2.53, 2.68, 2.88, 2.95, 3.2, 3.92, 4.12, 4.56, 4.73, 4.93, 5.11, 5.39, 5.52]}, {"scene": "nobid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "It’s not the first.", "t0": 83.56, "t1": 84.73, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Pier 94 shelter-in-place site", "kicker": "2022", "sub": "a grant it held as sponsor for United Council of Human Services"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.44, 0.57]}, {"scene": "nobid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "In 2022 it held a shelter grant at Pier 94, for United Council of Human Services.", "t0": 84.85, "t1": 89.81, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Pier 94 shelter-in-place site", "kicker": "2022", "sub": "a grant it held as sponsor for United Council of Human Services"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.37, 1.01, 1.16, 1.36, 1.43, 1.75, 2.03, 2.16, 2.46, 3.22, 3.41, 3.71, 4.04, 4.12, 4.35]}, {"scene": "nobid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "That one also sat just under the line: 9,988,252 dollars.", "t0": 89.93, "t1": 92.94, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Pier 94 shelter-in-place site", "kicker": "2022", "sub": "a grant it held as sponsor for United Council of Human Services"}, "emph": ["9,988,252"], "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.35, 0.63, 0.9, 1.1, 1.27, 1.38, 1.8, 2.07, 2.24, 2.5]}, {"scene": "nobid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[8]", "notEstablished[5]"], "text": "The City also pays rent to a related landlord,", "t0": 93.06, "t1": 95.4, "shot": "b_jelani", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "1601 Quesada Avenue", "kicker": "Landlord: Jelani Inc., a related organization", "sub": "master lease to the Homelessness department, file 190502", "chip": "$1,612,882 since fiscal 2019"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.36, 0.6, 0.84, 1.07, 1.2, 1.28, 1.62]}, {"scene": "nobid", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[8]", "notEstablished[5]"], "text": "Jelani Inc.: 1,612,882 dollars since fiscal 2019.", "t0": 95.4, "t1": 99.61, "shot": "b_jelani", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "1601 Quesada Avenue", "kicker": "Landlord: Jelani Inc., a related organization", "sub": "master lease to the Homelessness department, file 190502", "chip": "$1,612,882 since fiscal 2019"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.55, 1.26, 1.56, 1.74, 2.01, 2.24, 2.51, 2.88, 3.09, 3.46, 3.71]}, {"scene": "raise", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "On October 1, 2026, the homelessness department asked its oversight commission to raise that deal. To how much?", "t0": 99.83, "t1": 106.02, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "October 1, 2026", "kicker": "The request", "sub": "to the Homelessness Oversight Commission"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.57, 0.95, 1.24, 1.95, 2.12, 2.66, 3.13, 3.38, 3.53, 4.0, 4.37, 4.46, 4.65, 4.8, 5.53, 5.7, 5.83]}, {"scene": "raise", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "25,737,447 dollars.", "t0": 106.02, "t1": 108.04, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$25,737,447", "label": "new ceiling requested, through June 2029"}, "emph": ["25,737,447"], "wt": [0.04, 0.29, 0.77, 1.01, 1.24, 1.49]}, {"scene": "raise", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "defense[0]"], "text": "Its own memo lists the problem: audited financial statements not completed.", "t0": 108.56, "t1": 112.44, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Audited Financial statements not completed"}, "emph": ["not completed"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.34, 0.66, 0.87, 0.96, 1.76, 2.22, 2.66, 3.15, 3.34]}, {"scene": "raise", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "defense[0]"], "text": "The foundation expects to finish before the end of fiscal 2026-27.", "t0": 112.56, "t1": 116.44, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Audited Financial statements not completed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.58, 0.92, 1.03, 1.4, 1.65, 1.76, 1.89, 1.98, 2.33, 2.61, 3.12, 3.21]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "Tier 3 here rests on late audits and cash flow, not on any finding of misuse.", "t0": 116.66, "t1": 120.71, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Any misuse of money by the foundation", "Whether Tier 3 was weighed in these funding decisions"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.52, 0.73, 0.98, 1.11, 1.31, 1.61, 1.72, 2.01, 2.56, 2.78, 2.9, 3.08, 3.41, 3.51]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[1]", "next[2]"], "text": "What would settle it? The two missing audits. And the memo showing how that ceiling was set.", "t0": 120.83, "t1": 125.67, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The audited statements for FY2022-23 and FY2023-24"}, {"who": "", "what": "How the $9,989,926 ceiling was set"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.26, 0.54, 1.17, 1.33, 1.5, 1.79, 2.77, 2.95, 3.07, 3.5, 3.81, 3.93, 4.1, 4.43, 4.56]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "The raise is still pending.", "t0": 125.79, "t1": 126.88, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.35, 0.45, 0.68]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 127.0, "t1": 129.13, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.64, 0.79, 1.06, 1.16, 1.25, 1.5, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The tier", "why": "Why Tier 3", "money": "The money", "nobid": "A no-bid deal", "raise": "The raise", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "contrast"}